<Property name="PerformingLabInfo">
<Description>
PerformingLabInfo:  Used to input default performing lab info if none is provided in the record as a separate NTE. 
Comma separated with no spaces if nothing is provided you will still need a comma there ex: Ascend Lab,,Redwood City,CA,94063,USA,. 
First field is the name of the lab. Second field is the street address.
Third field is city. Fourth field is state. Fifth field is zip code. Sixth field is Country. Seventh field is CLIA number.</Description>
<Type>%String</Type>
<Parameter name="MAXLEN" value="1000"/>
</Property>

<Property name="MedicalDirectorInfo">
<Description>
MedicalDirectorInfo: Used to input medical director info if no performing lab info is provided as a separate NTE. 
Comma separated with no spaces if nothing is provided you will still need a comma there ex: Cookie,,Monster. First field is first name. Second field is middle initial.
Third field is last name. Fourth field is Degree (MD, etc.). </Description>
<Type>%String</Type>
<Parameter name="MAXLEN" value="1000"/>
</Property>

